<title>USA: Brooks Fiber says has 23 pct stake in Verio.</title>
<headline>Brooks Fiber says has 23 pct stake in Verio.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brooks Fiber Properties Inc said Friday it completed taking a 23 percent stake in private internet service provider Verio Inc.</p>
<p>The company said it bought $50 million of 13-1/2 percent senior notes due June 24 2004 and received warrants to acquire 704,160 Verio shares.</p>
<p>Brooks Fiber senior vice president Waymon Tipton said the transaction upped the company's stake in Verio to 23 percent on a fully-diluted basis, up from 22 percent.</p>
</text>
